[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0010","text":"哇……！\n透酱，有水母哦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0020","text":"真的\n飘啊飘的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0030","text":"嗯、嗯\n好漂亮啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0040","text":"怎么说呢，看着看着\n就想去摸一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0050","text":"不、不行的……！\n会被蜇到的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0060","text":"呵呵，没事的\n反正摸不到"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0070","text":"这家伙，心脏在哪里？\n伞那边？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0080","text":"那个……我记得\n水母好像没有心脏吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0090","text":"诶，没有吗？\n嘿——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_02_0100","text":"好厉害啊，你\n什么感觉？没有心脏的话"}]
